        "synopsis": {
            "value": "Jang Tae-Ha (Jung Hae-In) doesn't speak much, but he is warm-hearted. He was a promising young boxer before joining a gang. Now, he is living as a coach at a boxing gym.To leave the gang completely, he has to carry out one last mission given out by the gang. During his last order, he meets Go Eun-Sae (Ha-Young), who was his first love, but she doesn't remember him. To protect her, he tells her a lie.\n\nMeanwhile, Go Eun-Sae is a prosecutor in the Anti-Corruption Investigation Department at the Seoul Central District Prosecutor's Office. In order to seize a golden opportunity for get a promotion, she goes after a gang organization. But, her pursuit leads her to get involved in an unexpected accident. She then wakes up in an unfamiliar rural clinic. She doesn't remember anything, even her name, age, or job. At that time, Jang Tae-Ha comes to her and insists that he is her boyfriend.",
            "source": "asianwiki",
            "source_link": "https://asianwiki.com/Our_Sticky_Love"
        },
